# nexora-action-code: get_memory
Value TOTAL_MEMORY (\S+)
Value USED_MEMORY (\S+)
Value USED_PERCENT (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ -> Next
  ^\s*Total\s+memory:\s*${TOTAL_MEMORY}\s*KB,\s*Used\s+memory:\s*${USED_MEMORY}\s*KB\s*\(${USED_PERCENT}%\) -> Record
  ^\s*Total\s+memory\s+is\s+\d+\(${TOTAL_MEMORY}\)\s+bytes
  ^\s*Total\s+memory\s+is\s+${TOTAL_MEMORY}\s+bytes
  ^\s*Total\s+memory\s+used\s+is\s+\d+\(${USED_MEMORY}\)\s+bytes
  ^\s*Total\s+memory\s+used\s+is\s+${USED_MEMORY}\s+bytes
  ^\s*Current\s+memory\s+using\s+percentage\s+is\s+${USED_PERCENT}% -> Record
  ^\s*Current\s+memory\s+utilization\s+is\s+${USED_PERCENT}% -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
